direction: down
title: |md
  # Build and release pipeline
| {near: top-center}

push: |md
  **Push or pull request to main**

  starts both checks
| {shape: rectangle; class: actor}
checks: "Checks, run in parallel" {
  class: group
  test: |md
    **Test**

    black, flake8, mypy,

    pytest with a coverage gate
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
  scan: |md
    **Image scan**

    builds the image; Trivy fails on

    fixable critical or high findings
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
}
gate: |md
  **Release gate**

  both checks pass and

  the event is a push to main
| {shape: rectangle; class: key}
release: "Release" {
  class: group
  build: |md
    **Build image**

    tagged with the commit SHA
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
  hub: |md
    **Docker Hub**

    public image
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
  acr: |md
    **Azure Container Registry**

    same image, retagged
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
  app: |md
    **Azure App Service**

    runs the image for that commit
  | {shape: rectangle; class: good}
  build -> hub: "push" {style.stroke: "#556270"; style.font-color: "#556270"; style.font-size: 15}
  hub -> acr: "copy" {style.stroke: "#556270"; style.font-color: "#556270"; style.font-size: 15}
  acr -> app: "deploy by commit tag" {style.stroke: "#556270"; style.font-color: "#556270"; style.font-size: 15}
}

push -> checks.test
push -> checks.scan
checks.test -> gate
checks.scan -> gate
gate -> release.build
